It stays between us.

300
00:33:48,870 --> 00:33:50,030
It stays between us, Jamie.

301
00:33:51,144 --> 00:33:51,890
But you gotta go home.

302
00:33:52,030 --> 00:33:59,670
You can't make noise.

303
00:34:00,070 --> 00:34:03,090
Because somebody's gonna come in
here and think something's happening.

304
00:34:06,155 --> 00:34:07,570
There's not a friend.

305
00:34:07,799 --> 00:34:09,830
Someone called and answered anyone.

306
00:34:11,130 --> 00:34:18,231
If you stay here and someone finds out and
sees this, we're gonna get in a lot of trouble.

307
00:34:19,250 --> 00:34:24,250
Look, I had numbers to a woman shelter.

308
00:34:24,479 --> 00:34:25,630
I could bring you there.

309
00:34:25,949 --> 00:34:26,949
You would be safe there.

310
00:34:27,084 --> 00:34:28,409
You find me there.

311
00:34:31,990 --> 00:34:33,040
Can I stay with you?

312
00:34:37,520 --> 00:34:40,620
You wanna come to my house?

313
00:34:50,240 --> 00:34:51,350
Please, I'm sorry.

314
00:34:53,535 --> 00:34:57,670
Jamie, if I'm... Please let me stay with you.

315
00:35:03,415 --> 00:35:04,750
Okay, so...

316
00:35:05,654 --> 00:35:07,970
I let you stay tonight.

317
00:35:11,200 --> 00:35:16,531
Okay, my wife will be okay with maybe a
few days, but then she's gonna ask questions.

318
00:35:16,670 --> 00:35:17,610
Do you understand that?

319
00:35:17,611 --> 00:35:18,611
Yeah.

320
00:35:24,330 --> 00:35:25,730
You have to get dressed.

321
00:35:50,300 --> 00:35:51,440
You should get dressed.

322
00:35:56,010 --> 00:35:57,010
Hi, honey.

323
00:35:59,605 --> 00:36:01,170
I have something to ask you.

324
00:36:04,660 --> 00:36:06,090
A student needs help.

325
00:36:08,690 --> 00:36:10,090
And she doesn't know where to turn.

326
00:36:16,980 --> 00:36:19,340
She's gonna be staying with us for a few
days.

